ull,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1925452,1926424,1927502,1928505,null,null,null,1933373,1934981,1936305]},"desc":"Enter the Zone.\n\nZone STALKER is a hardcore atmospheric extraction survival game inspired by the legendary STALKER series. Scavenge abandoned industrial ruins, survive deadly anomalies, hunt mutants, and fight hostile factions across a dangerous open world consumed by the Zone.\n\nEvery expedition is a risk. Build your loadout, manage your supplies, complete tasks, and extract with your loot before the Zone takes everything from you.\n\nTravel alone or with up to 4 players in online co-op through dark forests, abandoned checkpoints, underground facilities, and radioactive wastelands where every gunshot echoes danger.\n\nFeatures:\n• Persistent character saving & progression\n• Personal stash system\n• Hardcore loot loss & extraction gameplay\n• Dynamic anomalies, emissions, and atmospheric events\n• AI factions, mutants, and random encounters\n• Randomly generated Task.\n• Detailed inventory & gear management system\n• Squad-based co-op survival\n\n(PRE-ALPHA) Expect bugs, wipes, and missing features!","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5a75cb37906fa1a4fe7766cd251186ae/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3aa40731ef62a62edd73aa9c100d46ea/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6e8ff7928f6a4f529b978e9c1144470d/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"]}